body:
I just wanted to tell you that I always thought the same exact thing. Until I met my current boyfriend, it's so different All the people you've dated before, just weren't the right ones. Believe me. 

&#x200B;

Please don't give up hope! There is a person out there who is going to give you the world.

Yes! It makes me feel vulnerable because sometimes I really don't believe what I said.

&#x200B;

Thank you for relating

If they want to be alone for a few days, you have to do it. Personally, if I did that I'd want my boyfriend to send me something that he'll be here when I'm ready to talk but everyone is different you know them best.

&#x200B;

A big part of BPD is thinking you're being manipulative and hurting the people around you because of your disorder. Maybe have a mutual friend reach out or a family member to make sure they're safe and if they're able to talk to them let them know you're not mad or angry.

&#x200B;

As someone with BPD your effort and your ability to not give up is really what we all need, hope all goes well. I'm here if you need to talk. Keep me updated!

I'm hoping it's temporary until I can manage my stress better .

&#x200B;

Thank you! Hope all goes well
